messages.content:
With two visits per month:

\[
2 \times 280 = 560\text{ miles}
\]

\[
560 \div 15 = 37.\overline{3}\text{ gallons}
\]

\[
37.\overline{3} \times \$3.50 = \boxed{\$130.67\text{ per month}}
\]

